hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"104","اللّهُـمَّ قِنـي عَذابَـكَ يَـوْمَ تَبْـعَثُ عِبـادَك .","","","","","While returning from travel"
"105","بِاسْـمِكَ اللّهُـمَّ أَمـوتُ وَأَحْـيا","","","","","What to say upon receiving pleasing or displeasing news"
